  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to verify the BagIt profile created in: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2222"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2222",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Potentially useful instructions: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Download the utility: ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/releases"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/releases",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Have a running Fedora ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "If you do not have a Fedora to test with, you may want to start up the \"one-click run\": ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Quick+Start#QuickStart-One-ClickRun"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Quick+Start#QuickStart-One-ClickRun",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Have data in your Fedora ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "If you do not have data in your Fedora, you will likely want to load some of your own or one of the existing example datasets: ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/tree/master/additional_datasets"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-sample-dataset/tree/master/additional_datasets",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Although there are minimal instructions in the readme linked above, if you run into issues loading any of these datasets, I would be happy to help... the possibility of issues arising is not inconceivable. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Export your data as Bagit bags ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "text": "Here are some minimal instructions: ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "type": "hardBreak"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/README.md#running-the-importexport-utility-with-a-bagit-support"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/README.md#running-the-importexport-utility-with-a-bagit-support",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To export APTrust-style bags, use the ''--bag-profile aptrust\" argument when running the utility. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The question to be answered is: Are the APTrust-style bags that the utility creates actually compliant with the APTrust expectations/requirements?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
