     "body": "<p>There are at least two issues with the current profile:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>AP Trust requires md5 manifests (currently the profile creates sha1 and sha256)</li>\n\t<li>AP Trust seems to disallow tag files with a space preceding the colon following the tag name.</li>\n</ul>\n",
